title: SalemDay0Start
---
The campus café was a hot spot for students during lunch time, but now as it's 
only morning, it was calm. The soft jazz music set the atmosphere, and as you 
entered, you saw only one worker on the floor. She was humming to yourself, 
a small smile on her face as she dried some glasses.
She heard the chimes of windpipes clashing together in sync and she looked over 
to you, and now you could see her face. She had a dreamy look in her face, 
as if she were lost in thought.
"Hiii," She said softly "Welcome to Portal and Prose," You looked at her, before 
approaching the counter. She was a soft looking person, soft smile adorning her 
face and wavy lavender hair. There was a welcoming energy emitting from her,
and it drew you in almost immediately

