title: AskName
---
”Hi…,” you said, smiling politely at her “How’re you?” The server blinked and smiled happily, as if no one had bothered to ask her that today. The thought made you feel a little bad, and she had enthusiastically giggled. 
“Im good, thank you so much!” She happily said, eyes cloning as she spoke. The simple question made her so happy, it made you surprised.
<<jump SinceYouNever>>
===

title: MakeTalk
---
Your fingers drummed on the counter, the server looking expectantly at you. The cafe was vacant other than you and her which seemed sort of peculiar.

"So...," you said with a start "Are you the only one working?"

Your attempt of making small talk seemed to fall on deaf ears as the server blinked and nodded slowly, seemingly confused. You got nervous, in hindsight, asking if someone is alone is...sort of concerning.

"Well yes I am," She answered easily, her small smile not fading once "There are more but they're on their breaks now, right now is our quietest hours so that's why I'm alone," You nodded and hummed. Huh, you supposed in actuality she didn't mind the question. Thank god.
<<jump SinceYouNever>>
===

title:AskForParticipant
---
Not wasting any time, you drummed your fingers on the counter. "Hi my name is Y/n. I need some volunteers for my last essay in Philosophy, and I was wondering if you'd be interested in being one," The server looked at you, face contorting in an awkward smile as she looked away. Oh...maybe you came off too strong.

"Are you here to order...?" She quickly diverted the conversation...and now you felt awkward
<<jump SinceYouNever>>
===

title: SinceYouNever
---
Since you never came to this cafe before, you didn't know exactly what was nice. With too much choice your eyes glided to the server who was waiting for what you wanted "Hmm...what would you recommend?" you softly asked, and for a second the server's eyes glimmered.

She stopped what she was doing, humming in thought before she sat down the glass she was drying."Ooooo," she said excitedly, leaning forward with her head resting on her hand "I'd recommend the caramel macchiato and the fudge brownie,"

Smiling, you nodded and ordered it, and she nodded with a happy smile. She seemed to be very friendly, this could be a chance to know more about her.

-> Compliment her hair
