===

title: ComplimentHair
---
You found their hair striking, the colour was very pretty, and before you knew it your mouth opened "Your hair is really pretty," tumbled out of your mouth before you could pull it back. The server beamed happily at you, her fingers twirling her hair before giggling. You slowly blinked, she really liked the compliment.

"Thank you!!" she giddily chirped, eyes closed. She hummed happily as she made your coffee and placed your brownie on your tray, and your initial nervousness disappeared. Her natural bright energy clouded whatever anxious thoughts you had; she seemed naturally bright and kind.

"It's no bother," You sheepishly replied, but still she beamed and giggled, eyes curving and looking like crescent moons
<<jump FoodArrives>>
===

title: AskAboutJob
---
"So," You started. The server looked at you while she brewed your coffee and hummed as if to say she's listening "What's it like being a cafe barista?" She turned around with the freshly made coffee in hand, placing it on a tray.

"Hmm," She was actually thinking hard about this "It's nice, I do like it...sometimes it's stressful but that's like all jobs," she takes some tongs, taking one muffin from the collection of muffins and setting it on a plate, moving it on the tray too.
<<jump FoodArrives>>
===

title: StaySilent
---
You decided against it. It seemed sort of early to ask about herself. Wouldn’t it be creepy?  She placed the coffee on a tray, and then she placed the brownie down as well. She finally looked back at you, and with a soft, gentle smile tilted her head at your staring
<<jump FoodArrives>>
===

title: FoodArrives
---
"Here's your order, dear," She said nicely, setting your drink and snack down on  tray for you "That will be 11.99,"

You tapped your phone to the card reader, and she went back to tidying things up as you sat on an empty chair.

